[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8820.23, "timestamp": "02:27:00", "text": "もの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8821.91, "timestamp": "02:27:01", "text": "赤ちゃん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8825.67, "timestamp": "02:27:05", "text": "ええ、それがこの地図です。いいえ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8827.91, "timestamp": "02:27:07", "text": "スカルがその男だった。頭蓋骨はそこにあった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8829.59, "timestamp": "02:27:09", "text": "いいえ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8832.79, "timestamp": "02:27:12", "text": "頭蓋骨。そう、究極のものだ。これまでのところ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8835.349, "timestamp": "02:27:15", "text": "倒すのが一番難しいのは赤だ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8837.59, "timestamp": "02:27:17", "text": "1つ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8840.07, "timestamp": "02:27:20", "text": "赤い方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8842.469, "timestamp": "02:27:22", "text": "それが何なのかはっきりとはわからないけど、まあ、そうだね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8858.309, "timestamp": "02:27:38", "text": "慎重に進んでポイントを捉えてください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8860.389, "timestamp": "02:27:40", "text": "何てことだ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8862.23, "timestamp": "02:27:42", "text": "私はほとんど"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8868.15, "timestamp": "02:27:48", "text": "殺された ああ、噛まれた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8876.07, "timestamp": "02:27:56", "text": "なぜ戻ったのですか？それ以外は何もない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8879.19, "timestamp": "02:27:59", "text": "私たちは全てを略奪したと思う。"}]